{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22430","headline":"郡厅有树晚荣早凋人不识名因题其上 · 白居易","name":"郡厅有树晚荣早凋人不识名因题其上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浔阳郡厅後，有树不知名。\n秋先梧桐落，春後桃李荣。\n五月始萌动，八月已凋零。\n左右皆松桂，四时郁青青。\n岂量雨露恩，沾濡不均平。\n荣枯各有分，天地本无情。\n顾我亦相类，早衰向晚成。\n形骸少多病，三十不丰盈。\n毛鬓早改变，四十白髭生。\n谁教两萧索，相对此江城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}